#. [campaign]: id=The_Hammer_of_Thursagan
#: data/campaigns/The_Hammer_of_Thursagan/_main.cfg:46
#| msgid ""
#| "In the first years of the Northern Alliance, an expedition from Knalga seeks out their kin at Kal Kartha and to learn the fate of the legendary Hammer of Thursagan. The perils of their journey through the wild Northern Lands, though great, pale beside the evil they will face at its end.\n"
#| "\n"
msgid ""
"In the first years of the Northern Alliance, an expedition from Knalga seeks out their kin at Kal Kartha and to learn the fate of the legendary Hammer of Thursagan. The perils of their journey through the wild Northlands, though great, pale beside the evil they will face at its end.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Kuzey İttifakı'nın ilk yıllarında Knalga'dan gelen bir keşif grubu, Kal "
"Kartha'daki akrabalarını arar ve efsanevi Thursagan Çekici'nin kaderini "
"öğrenir. Vahşi Kuzey Toprakları'ndaki yolculuklarının tehlikeleri, her ne "
"kadar büyük olsa da, sonunda karşılaşacakları kötülük yanında sönük kalır."

